00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:07.890
brand new at that time and the book is
The Idea: The Seven Elements of a Viable

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:12.840
Story for Screening, Stage or Fiction. I'm
not sure if we asked you this before but

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.199
how much of the book is dedicated to
developing the character and how much of

00:00:16.199 --> 00:00:23.699
it is dedicated developing plot? Erik Bork, Author/Screenwriter: It's a
good question you know it's really its

00:00:23.699 --> 00:00:29.400
concept driven almost more than
